WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
<v Mike>Thunder and Lightning!

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.180
<v Mike>The Thunder Warrior is not pleased with Mr.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.600
<v Mike>Chin's meal-chasing escapade!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:31.560
<v Mike>And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.620
<v Hosts>I'm Mike. And I'm Sean.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.420
<v Mike>Did you know that this breakout game had a story?

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.480
<v Sean>I was going to ask what you meant by meal-chasing?

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:43.760
<v Mike>Like he's... Meal-chasing escapades.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:47.060
<v Sean>Like a shooter, like having a cup of coffee after dinner?

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.180
<v Sean>Is that what we're talking about?

