<v Mike>So, the manual positions this as another one of Mr.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:56.740
<v Mike>Chin's misadventures. Like as if we're all familiar with Mr.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.220
<v Mike>Chin and his crazy antics, and this is like the seventh NES game in the Mr.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:04.700
<v Mike>Chin franchise. But that's not true.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.960
<v Mike>There's just... There was a Game Boy game that came out before this called Mr.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.700
<v Mike>Chin's Gourmet Paradise.

