<v Mike>And what's weird about that is that's not a breakout or I guess like this maybe Arkanoid's better here.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.340
<v Mike>It's not a Arkanoid clone.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.380
<v Mike>It's a puzzle platformer.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.800
<v Mike>It's like a completely different game.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:28.300
<v Mike>But in that one, it at least is more food oriented.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:29.740
<v Mike>So, I guess Mr.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:34.880
<v Mike>Chin is like maybe a chef or maybe he just loves to eat or something.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.200
<v Mike>Cool. But that's where this all comes into.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:41.540
<v Sean>But I don't think you can just frame this around Mr.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.720
<v Mike>Chin if you don't know him.

