<v Sean>Because I was thinking Breakout clone the whole time.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:07.160
<v Mike>Yeah, I guess I'm struggling to remember now like why I wrote down Arkanoid instead of Breakout.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.680
<v Mike>So, I'll need to just look at a quick visual.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:13.420
<v Mike>But for me, Breakout is always like the simplest version of that.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.160
<v Mike>And then like Arkanoid, I feel like added the power ups.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.020
